<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 bln guilder-into-euro 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 bln guilder-into-euro 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.0 BLN DFL   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    15.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.775   PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.10     SPREAD	+12.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	DEAL MAY BE REDENOMINATED IN EUROS FROM 01.JAN.99.</p>
<p>		THE ISSUE MAY ALSO BE CONSOLIDATED WITH OTHER EIB</p>
<p>		ISSUES WITH IDENTICAL TERMS AND CONDITIONS.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST/LUX  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FEB 2007 DSL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
